OL,3,GNEWSAResidents fear villages will merge
OL,4,Aunder plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents say they fear their villages
OL,7,Fcould merge if house building is
OL,8,Fallowed on green spaces.
OL,10,FPlans have been lodged for 150 homes in
OL,11,FWaltham, near Grimsby, while an appeal
OL,12,Fis under way after 300 homes were
OL,13,Frejected in nearby Scartho.
OL,15,FDieter Nelson, the agent for the
OL,16,FWaltham development, said it would
OL,17,Fassist with the under-delivery of
OL,18,Fhousing across North East Lincolnshire
OL,19,Fand support and sustain village
OL,20,Fservices.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
