OL,3,GNEWSAResidents fear villages will merge
OL,4,Aunder plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Councillor Philip Jackson, who is
OL,7,Fopposing the plans, said local building
OL,8,Ftargets were "undeliverable", while
OL,9,FFiona Chapman, who lives near Waltham,
OL,10,Fsaid it would no longer be rural
OL,11,FLincolnshire, but "one town".
